<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - SOCCER CUP FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - SOCCER CUP FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian Cup final results on Wednesday: Zalgiris 1 Inkaras 0 (0:0). Donatas Vencevichius scored a penalty shot on 75 minute.</p>
<p>--Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 17</p>
